  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Complete squirrel-like early euarchont with pointed elongated muzzle and projecting incisors, long furry tail, four clawed limbs. Not a modern monkey or rodent, not a skull-only replacement. [\"Mounted UM87990 includes reconstructed light-gray parts. Do not treat mount pose as fossil life pose.\", \"2019 describes17preserved caudals and at least3missing anterior; total tail proportions reconstructed.\", \"Some associated metacarpals may be Uintacyon; avoid falsely exact finger proportions.\", \"Ear shape, fur density/color, soft body depth and pose inferred.\", \"Plesiadapiform phylogenetic position not a modern crown monkey.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"estimated_skull_length_m\": 0.10583, \"skull_provenance\": \"Boyer and Gingerich2019 Table4 estimated UM87990 cranial length; NOT direct measurement.\", \"estimated_head_body_length_m\": 0.35, \"estimated_tail_length_m\": 0.35, \"body_tail_provenance\": \"Model reconstruction choices guided by skeleton, not published exact live lengths.\", \"2005_figure_scale\": \"Fig1 approximates skull/femur/ulna each9cm; skull superseded for this model by2019 estimated105.83mm. Do not label both direct measured values.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Complete squirrel-like early euarchont with pointed elongated muzzle and projecting incisors, long furry tail, four clawed limbs. Not a modern monkey or rodent, not a skull-only replacement. [\"Mounted UM87990 includes reconstructed light-gray parts. Do not treat mount pose as fossil life pose.\", \"2019 describes17preserved caudals and at least3missing anterior; total tail proportions reconstructed.\", \"Some associated metacarpals may be Uintacyon; avoid falsely exact finger proportions.\", \"Ear shape, fur density/color, soft body depth and pose inferred.\", \"Plesiadapiform phylogenetic position not a modern crown monkey.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"estimated_skull_length_m\": 0.10583, \"skull_provenance\": \"Boyer and Gingerich2019 Table4 estimated UM87990 cranial length; NOT direct measurement.\", \"estimated_head_body_length_m\": 0.35, \"estimated_tail_length_m\": 0.35, \"body_tail_provenance\": \"Model reconstruction choices guided by skeleton, not published exact live lengths.\", \"2005_figure_scale\": \"Fig1 approximates skull/femur/ulna each9cm; skull superseded for this model by2019 estimated105.83mm. Do not label both direct measured values.\"}"
  },
